  "label": "Body Part Focus",
  "description": "A stereotype that involves focusing on specific body parts of a person, often in a sexualized or degrading manner, to define their value or worth. In this meme, the hands are singled out as the primary focus, implying that their appearance (or lack thereof) is the only thing of value, which is a form of body part focus.",
